# 10. App Bootstrap

Application startup must be staged.

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant App
    participant Bootstrap
    participant Stores
    participant Registry
    participant Engines
    participant UI

    App->>Bootstrap: Start
    Bootstrap->>Stores: Load local preferences and metadata
    Bootstrap->>Registry: Restore known devices
    Bootstrap->>Engines: Start scene and automation services
    Bootstrap->>Registry: Start integrations
    Bootstrap-->>UI: Publish usable cached state
    Registry-->>UI: Publish live updates progressively
```

Recommended phases:

1. Construct dependencies
2. Load critical settings
3. Restore navigation state
4. Restore cached devices and rooms
5. Initialize registries and engines
6. Present usable UI
7. Start live synchronization
8. Run deferred health checks

The app must not block initial rendering while every device reconnects.

