# 11. App Environment

Use one explicit dependency container created at startup.

```swift
struct AppEnvironment: Sendable {
    let deviceRegistry: any DeviceRegistryProviding
    let sceneEngine: any SceneEngineProviding
    let automationEngine: any AutomationEngineProviding
    let discoveryService: any DeviceDiscovering
    let diagnosticsCenter: any DiagnosticsProviding
    let settingsRepository: any SettingsRepository
    let navigationStore: NavigationStore
    let haptics: any HapticProviding
    let logger: any AuraLogging
    let clock: any AuraClock
}
```

The environment is composition, not business logic.

Avoid a mutable service locator that any code can query globally.

Dependencies should be injected into feature roots or application services.

