# 58. Implementation Sequence

Recommended order:

1. Domain identifiers and models
2. Design tokens and core components
3. App environment and bootstrap
4. Persistence contracts
5. Unified Device Registry
6. Discovery coordinator
7. Mock integration plugin
8. Dashboard and room presentation
9. Hue integration
10. HomeKit integration
11. Philips TV integration
