# 60. Release Readiness Gates

Before Version 1 release:

- No secrets appear in logs.
- Core engines have automated tests.
- Plugin failures remain isolated.
- Navigation restores safely.
- Device identity survives reconnect and IP changes.
- Background limitations are represented honestly.
- Unsupported capabilities remain hidden.
- Real-hardware tests pass.
- Accessibility checks pass.
- Memory and performance targets are measured.
- Diagnostics exports are sanitized.

