# 64. Golden Rule

Aura's architecture should make complex smart-home systems feel simple without making the codebase dishonest about that complexity.

Complexity belongs behind clear boundaries.

The user should experience one calm home.

The codebase should remain a collection of understandable, testable and replaceable systems.

